desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "csharp"
	title: "Struct scan: C# HttpClient.GetAsync"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：C# HttpClient.GetAsync"
	type: vuln
	level: medium
	rule_id: "struct-csharp-httpclient-getasync"
	risk: "ssrf"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 HttpClient.GetAsync。URL 若外部可控可导致 SSRF。

### 风险类型
ssrf

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
主机和协议由程序固定，或使用允许列表。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://H.cs": <<<POS
using System.Net.Http;
class H { void Bad(HttpClient c, string u) { c.GetAsync(u); } }

POS
	"safefile://S.cs": <<<NEG
class S { void Ok() {} }

NEG
)

GetAsync as $call
GetAsync(* as $u) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "medium",
	title: "Struct scan: C# HttpClient.GetAsync",
	title_zh: "结构扫描：C# HttpClient.GetAsync",
	message: "结构扫描：C# HttpClient.GetAsync",
	risk: "ssrf",
}
